    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head>Cn 1018 16</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="16" corresp="#wit-d">And sy ælc wuduwe þe hy silfe mid rihte gehealde. on godes griðe 7 on ðæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And sy ælc wuduwe þe hy silfe mid rihte gehealde on Godes griðe and on ðæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And let every widow who conducts herself in a proper manner be in the protection of God and the king.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And all widows who comport themselves properly shall be under the protection of God and the king.</ab>
      </div>
